{
  "formatVersion": 2,
  "@define": {"jumping": {"live": {"or": [{"not": ["entityIsOnGround"]}, {"lt": ["entityTicksAfterTouchdown", 1]}]}}},
  "layers": [
    {
      "select": [
        {"when": "animator.jumping", "then": "jump"},
        {"when": "entityIsStandingStill", "then": "stand"},
        {"then": "walk"}
      ],
      "nodes": {
        "stand": {
          "core:pose": {
            "pose": [
              {
                "core:clip": {"animationKey": "mobends:bends/animations/villager/rest.json"},
                "@damping": {"rightLeg": 0.5, "foreRightLeg": 0.5, "leftLeg": 0.5, "foreLeftLeg": 0.5, "body": 0.5, "arms": 0.5}
              },
              {
                "core:clip": {
                  "animationKey": "mobends:bends/animations/villager/walk.json",
                  "frame": {"mod": [{"mul": ["entityLimbSwing", 0.6662]}, "clipLength"]},
                  "weight": "entityLimbSwingAmount"
                },
                "@damping": {"rightLeg": 10, "foreRightLeg": 10, "leftLeg": 10, "foreLeftLeg": 10}
              },
              {
                "core:clip": {
                  "animationKey": "mobends:bends/animations/villager/idle.json",
                  "frame": {"mod": [{"mul": ["ticks", 0.09]}, "clipLength"]}
                },
                "@damping": {"head": 0.5, "arms": 0.5}
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "head", "axis": "y", "angle": "entityHeadYaw"},
                "@space": "pre",
                "@damping": {"head": 0.5}
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "head", "axis": "x", "angle": "entityHeadPitch"},
                "@space": "post"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "walk": {
          "core:pose": {
            "pose": [
              {
                "core:clip": {"animationKey": "mobends:bends/animations/villager/rest.json"},
                "@damping": {"rightLeg": 0.5, "foreRightLeg": 0.5, "leftLeg": 0.5, "foreLeftLeg": 0.5, "body": 0.5, "arms": 0.5}
              },
              {
                "core:clip": {
                  "animationKey": "mobends:bends/animations/villager/walk.json",
                  "frame": {"mod": [{"mul": ["entityLimbSwing", 0.6662]}, "clipLength"]},
                  "weight": "entityLimbSwingAmount"
                },
                "@damping": {"rightLeg": 10, "foreRightLeg": 10, "leftLeg": 10, "foreLeftLeg": 10}
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "body", "axis": "y", "angle": "node.twist"},
                "@space": "pre"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "arms", "axis": "y", "angle": "node.twist"},
                "@space": "pre"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "head", "axis": "y", "angle": "entityHeadYaw"},
                "@space": "override",
                "@damping": {"head": 0.5}
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "head", "axis": "x", "angle": "entityHeadPitch"},
                "@space": "post"
              }
            ]
          },
          "@define": {
            "twist": {"live": {"mul": [{"cos": [{"mul": ["entityLimbSwing", 0.6662]}]}, 5, "entityLimbSwingAmount"]}}
          }
        },
        "jump": {
          "core:pose": {
            "pose": [
              {
                "core:clip": {"animationKey": "mobends:bends/animations/villager/rest.json", "bones": ["body", "arms"]},
                "@damping": {"body": 0.5, "arms": 0.5}
              },
              {
                "core:clip": {"animationKey": "mobends:bends/animations/villager/jump.json"},
                "@damping": {"rightLeg": 0.3, "foreRightLeg": 0.3, "leftLeg": 0.3, "foreLeftLeg": 0.3}
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "head", "axis": "y", "angle": "entityHeadYaw"},
                "@space": "override",
                "@damping": {"head": 0.5}
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "head", "axis": "x", "angle": "entityHeadPitch"},
                "@space": "post"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "@comment": "The villager walks by a clip that swings its legs (the feet slide, as vanilla's do), and stands and turns on its feet as the iron golem does: core:step_turn plants them in the world and turns the body only as far as they have stepped, light on them (quick steps, little weight shifted or rolled over the planted foot, the body following its feet on a stiffer spring). It is off while the villager walks or jumps; when it stops, the driver comes back on at once, with each foot planted where the walk left it, a foot in the air coming down where it is (placeFromPose: the stand node plays the walk too, weighted by the limb swing, which winds down over the ticks after it stops, so the pose beneath is still the walk's as the driver comes in; the walk's legs aren't smoothed, as vanilla's aren't, so they are drawn where the driver plants the feet), and a foot further than finishDrift from its place steps back under the body; nearer, it stays where the walk left it. It doesn't crouch (crouch, walkCrouch), so the villager stands as high as it walks, the hips going down only as far as feet planted apart need to reach (at most walkCrouch), easing down over crouchDrop ticks. RenderVillager draws the model at 0.9375 of its size, and a baby's at half that again, so a block is 16 / 0.9375 model units for a grown villager and twice that for a baby, which has its own, quicker driver. The nose hangs from the face on a loose spring: each step kicks it out (the walk's footfalls, a pulse twice a stride, and the driver's steps landing, stepImpact) and it swings back, hardly into the face; it sways sideways with the stride and the stepping foot. Standing, the upper body reacts lightly: the folded arms and the torso swing a little against the legs, the head keeps looking where the villager looks and nods as a foot lands. Landing, it gives a little (a kick on a spring).",
      "defaultOnEntry": "planted",
      "nodes": {
        "planted": {
          "core:pose": {
            "pose": [
              {
                "core:accumulate": {"inout": "node.onFeet", "rate": {"if": [{"or": ["animator.jumping", {"not": ["entityIsStandingStill"]}]}, -0.5, 4]}, "min": 0, "max": 1}
              },
              {"core:accumulate": {"inout": "node.landing", "rate": -0.35, "min": 0, "max": 1}},
              {
                "core:spring": {"inout": "node.landKick", "target": "node.landing", "stiffness": 0.4, "friction": 0.4}
              },
              {
                "@when": {"not": ["entityIsChild"]},
                "core:step_turn": {
                  "weight": "node.onFeet",
                  "unitsPerBlock": 17.0667,
                  "legs": [
                    {"upper": "rightLeg", "lower": "foreRightLeg", "hip": [-2, 12, 0], "knee": [0, 6, -2], "foot": [0, 6, 2]},
                    {"upper": "leftLeg", "lower": "foreLeftLeg", "hip": [2, 12, 0], "knee": [0, 6, -2], "foot": [0, 6, 2]}
                  ],
                  "turnThreshold": 15,
                  "maxStepAngle": 45,
                  "stepDuration": 5,
                  "stepHeight": 2.5,
                  "stepPause": 1,
                  "strideLength": 10,
                  "minStepDuration": 2.5,
                  "finishDrift": 4,
                  "driftThreshold": 5,
                  "settleAngle": 4,
                  "resetDistance": 20,
                  "placeFromPose": true,
                  "bodyStiffness": 0.22,
                  "bodyDamping": 0.7,
                  "runSpeed": 0.1,
                  "runBodyStiffness": 1.5,
                  "runBodyDamping": 2.5,
                  "runStrideLength": 17,
                  "runStepHeight": 3,
                  "runFacingSmoothing": 3,
                  "crouch": 0,
                  "walkCrouch": 1,
                  "crouchDrop": 4,
                  "impactDepth": 0.6,
                  "impactTime": 1.5,
                  "weightShift": 0.6,
                  "weightRoll": 1.5,
                  "out": {
                    "turnLag": "node.turnLag",
                    "turnSpeed": "node.turnSpeed",
                    "stepLift": "node.stepLift",
                    "stepImpact": "node.stepImpact",
                    "stride": "node.stride"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "@when": "entityIsChild",
                "core:step_turn": {
                  "weight": "node.onFeet",
                  "unitsPerBlock": 34.1333,
                  "legs": [
                    {"upper": "rightLeg", "lower": "foreRightLeg", "hip": [-2, 12, 0], "knee": [0, 6, -2], "foot": [0, 6, 2]},
                    {"upper": "leftLeg", "lower": "foreLeftLeg", "hip": [2, 12, 0], "knee": [0, 6, -2], "foot": [0, 6, 2]}
                  ],
                  "turnThreshold": 15,
                  "maxStepAngle": 45,
                  "stepDuration": 4,
                  "stepHeight": 2.5,
                  "stepPause": 1,
                  "strideLength": 10,
                  "minStepDuration": 2,
                  "finishDrift": 4,
                  "driftThreshold": 5,
                  "settleAngle": 4,
                  "resetDistance": 24,
                  "placeFromPose": true,
                  "bodyStiffness": 0.3,
                  "bodyDamping": 0.8,
                  "runSpeed": 0.05,
                  "runBodyStiffness": 2,
                  "runBodyDamping": 3,
                  "runStrideLength": 18,
                  "runStepHeight": 3,
                  "runFacingSmoothing": 3,
                  "crouch": 0,
                  "walkCrouch": 1,
                  "crouchDrop": 4,
                  "impactDepth": 0.5,
                  "impactTime": 1.2,
                  "weightShift": 0.4,
                  "weightRoll": 1,
                  "out": {
                    "turnLag": "node.turnLag",
                    "turnSpeed": "node.turnSpeed",
                    "stepLift": "node.stepLift",
                    "stepImpact": "node.stepImpact",
                    "stride": "node.stride"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "core:spring": {"inout": "node.jolt", "target": "node.stepImpact", "stiffness": 0.45, "friction": 0.6}
              },
              {
                "core:spring": {"inout": "node.swing", "target": "node.stride", "stiffness": 0.2, "friction": 0.35}
              },
              {
                "core:spring": {
                  "inout": "node.noseX",
                  "target": {
                    "add": [
                      {"mul": [{"max": [0, {"sub": [0.5, {"abs": [{"cos": [{"mul": ["entityLimbSwing", 0.6662]}]}]}]}]}, "entityLimbSwingAmount", -28]},
                      {"mul": ["node.stepImpact", -5]},
                      {"mul": ["node.landKick", -12]}
                    ]
                  },
                  "stiffness": 1.6,
                  "friction": 0.35
                }
              },
              {
                "core:spring": {
                  "inout": "node.noseZ",
                  "target": {
                    "add": [
                      {"mul": [{"sin": [{"mul": ["entityLimbSwing", 0.6662]}]}, "entityLimbSwingAmount", 6]},
                      {"mul": ["node.stepLift", 5]}
                    ]
                  },
                  "stiffness": 0.5,
                  "friction": 0.35
                }
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "nose", "axis": "x", "angle": {"clamp": ["node.noseX", -25, 2]}},
                "@space": "override"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "nose", "axis": "z", "angle": {"clamp": ["node.noseZ", -12, 12]}},
                "@space": "post"
              },
              {
                "core:spring": {"inout": "node.lag", "target": "node.turnSpeed", "stiffness": 0.2, "friction": 0.4}
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {
                  "bone": "head",
                  "axis": "y",
                  "angle": {"sub": [{"clamp": [{"add": ["entityHeadYaw", "node.turnLag"]}, -85, 85]}, "entityHeadYaw"]}
                },
                "@space": "pre"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "head", "axis": "x", "angle": {"mul": [{"mul": ["node.jolt", 3]}, "node.onFeet"]}},
                "@space": "post"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "body", "axis": "y", "angle": {"mul": ["node.twist", "node.onFeet"]}},
                "@space": "pre"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "arms", "axis": "y", "angle": {"mul": ["node.twist", "node.onFeet"]}},
                "@space": "pre"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "arms", "axis": "x", "angle": {"mul": [{"mul": ["node.jolt", -4]}, "node.onFeet"]}},
                "@space": "post"
              },
              {
                "core:vector": {"bone": "root", "x": 0, "y": {"mul": ["node.landKick", -1]}, "z": 0},
                "@damping": {"root": [0.3, null, 0.3]}
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "body", "axis": "x", "angle": {"mul": ["node.landKick", 3]}},
                "@space": "post"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "head", "axis": "x", "angle": {"mul": ["node.landKick", 4]}},
                "@space": "post"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "arms", "axis": "x", "angle": {"mul": ["node.landKick", -6]}},
                "@space": "post"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "rightLeg", "axis": "x", "angle": {"mul": ["node.landKick", -12]}},
                "@space": "pre"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "leftLeg", "axis": "x", "angle": {"mul": ["node.landKick", -12]}},
                "@space": "pre"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "foreRightLeg", "axis": "x", "angle": {"mul": ["node.landKick", 20]}},
                "@space": "post"
              },
              {
                "core:axis_rotate": {"bone": "foreLeftLeg", "axis": "x", "angle": {"mul": ["node.landKick", 20]}},
                "@space": "post"
              }
            ]
          },
          "@define": {
            "onFeet": {"state": 0},
            "turnLag": {"state": 0},
            "turnSpeed": {"state": 0},
            "stepLift": {"state": 0},
            "stepImpact": {"state": 0},
            "stride": {"state": 0},
            "jolt": {"state": 0},
            "swing": {"state": 0},
            "lag": {"state": 0},
            "noseX": {"state": 0},
            "noseZ": {"state": 0},
            "twist": {"live": {"clamp": [{"add": [{"mul": ["node.turnLag", 0.3]}, {"mul": ["node.lag", -1.5]}, {"mul": ["node.swing", 0.8]}]}, -12, 12]}},
            "landing": {"state": 0},
            "landKick": {"state": 0}
          },
          "@on": {
            "update": [
              {"@when": {"decreased": ["entityTicksAfterTouchdown"]}, "set": ["node.landing", 1]}
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
